{"version":1,"content":"<p>在56年前，也就是1970年11月17日，美國專利局向道格拉斯·恩格爾巴特頒發了編號3541541的專利，名稱為「顯示系統的X-Y位置指示器」。這串拗口的描述，其實就是今天人人熟悉的計算機鼠標。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586926.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.449149+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:11:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:20:56.974420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:20:56.974420+00:00","content_hash":"61b7d46da7b82387ac88da7d82dd4dbe6729c4ac4581d8448949088ac275e322","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}